# Mesma quebra de linha (LF) em Windows, macOS e Linux: o Prettier e o CI conferem LF.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binários
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary

